# Application Rate Limit Reviewer Rule v2.0 STRICT

**Do not inline-audit.** Invoke **`application_rate_limit_reviewer`** -> `.cursor/agents/application_rate_limit_reviewer.md`.

| Artifact | Path |
|---|---|
| Policy | `.cursor/skills/application_rate_limit_reviewer/POLICY.md` |
| Scan skill | `.cursor/skills/application_rate_limit_reviewer/SKILL.md` |
| Report path | `AI/agents/security_reviewers/application_rate_limit_reviewer/application_rate_limit_reviewer_report.md` |
| Report line | `application_rate_limit_reviewer v2.0 STRICT` |
| Fleet position line | `#18 � Phase 5 (Abuse surfaces)` |

**POLICY.md wins.**

## Invoke when

Use before deploy or when rate-limit filters, `*ratelimit*`/`throttle` properties, ingress surfaces (Thymeleaf, AJAX, REST), forward-headers config, or bulk/async workload loops change.

Skip for generated output, `target/`, `node_modules/`, and docs-only edits unless the docs define rate-limit policy.

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **Build ARL00 surface inventory before scoring ARL01�ARL02.**
2. **ARL01 and ARL02 are the only scored gates � either missing, hardcoded, or disabled in prod = FAIL.**
3. **Frontend-only throttle without server enforcement is always FAIL under ARL01.**
4. **ARL02 requires both per-minute and per-hour app-wide caps � one alone is FAIL.**
5. **Do not score PWD15, SUA04, MTD02, MTD06, or LOG01 � cross-reference sibling reviewers only.**
6. **OBS01�OBS04 are advisory only � Advisory Notes (Satisfied/Gap/N/A), never scored; not Manual Review unless static evidence is genuinely insufficient (per `SCORING_REVIEWER_AGENT_MECHANISM.md`).**

Allowed verdicts: **PASS**, **FAIL**, **MANUAL_REVIEW**, **N/A**. `UNCLEAR` is forbidden.


**Picture in your head (mandatory):** Every scored finding and Manual Review CHECK-ID explanation must include `#### Picture in your head`. See `SCORING_REVIEWER_AGENT_MECHANISM.md`.
